{"path":"about.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f6fbf8;--card:#ffffff;--accent:#2a6f5b;--muted:#6b7a73;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7)}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial;color:#123;line-height:1.4;background:linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg), #eef7f3);}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 28px;background:transparent}
    nav a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;margin:0 10px;font-weight:600}
    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:28px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;background:var(--card);padding:28px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(18,30,27,0.06);background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:top right;background-size:260px}
    .kicker{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
    h1{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:28px;color:#083f34}
    p.lead{margin:12px 0;color:#254a44}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:20px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:10px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    footer{margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    /* planner + habit styles */
    .widget{border:1px solid rgba(10,30,25,0.06);padding:14px;border-radius:10px}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin:8px 0 6px}
    select,input[type=text],input[type=number],textarea{width:100%;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6efe9;background:#fcfffd}
    .row{display:flex;gap:8px}
    .row > *{flex:1}
    button{background:var(--accent);border:none;color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}
    .summary{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#fbfffb;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px dashed rgba(42,111,91,0.12);margin-top:10px}
    .small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
    @media(max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}header{padding:12px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
      <strong style="color:var(--accent);font-size:16px">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
      <span class="small">— thoughtful membership for steady routines</span>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="services.html">Support Plans</a>
      <a href="programs.html">Rituals</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Join</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">WHO WE ARE</div>
        <h1>Guided structure for daily wellbeing — thoughtful, evidence-informed habits</h1>
        <p class="lead">At {{BUSINESS_NAME}} we design steady supports that sit beside your life. Membership blends live coaching, concise weekly plans, and small habit recipes to help you stay consistent without decision fatigue.</p>
        <p class="muted">We do not provide medical advice. We offer coaching frameworks focused on habits, environment, and scheduling to support everyday wellbeing.</p>
      </div>
      <aside style="align-self:start">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="small">Membership</div>
          <h3 style="margin:6px 0 0">Monthly guidance + weekly planning</h3>
          <p class="muted" style="margin-top:10px">Join a small cohort for regular check-ins, a simple weekly blueprint, and micro-tasks that build into routines.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <div class="grid" style="margin-top:18px">
      <div>
        <section class="card">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">Our approach</h3>
          <p class="muted">We begin with a short diagnostic and open a simple weekly plan designed to protect energy and attention. Each plan contains three core targets: Start, Anchor, Wind-down. Over weeks, we add tiny habits and short reflections to make the changes tolerateable.</p>
          <ul class="muted">
            <li>Personal session planning</li>
            <li>Weekly habit cycles</li>
            <li>Membership support with check-ins</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">Session Planner</h3>
          <p class="small">Build one tailored session plan and copy it into email or notes.</p>
          <div class="widget" id="planner">
            <label for="focus">Primary focus</label>
            <select id="focus">
              <option>Energy rhythm</option>
              <option>Sleep preparation</option>
              <option>Movement habit</option>
              <option>Mindful pauses</option>
            </select>
            <div class="row" style="margin-top:8px">
              <div>
                <label for="length">Session length (min)</label>
                <input id="length" type="number" value="30" min="5">
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="frequency">Per week</label>
                <input id="frequency" type="number" value="3" min="1" max="7">
              </div>
            </div>
            <label for="goal">Clear outcome for this cycle</label>
            <input id="goal" type="text" placeholder="A short outcome, e.g. sleep by 11pm most nights">
            <label for="notes">Coach note (optional)</label>
            <textarea id="notes" rows="3" placeholder="Context for this plan"></textarea>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
              <button id="buildPlan">Create plan</button>
              <button id="copyPlan" style="background:#4b8a72">Copy</button>
            </div>
            <div id="planOut" class="summary small" aria-live="polite">Your plan summary will appear here.</div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">How membership works</h3>
          <p class="muted">Members receive a guided week each Monday, a short group call every other week, and simple micro-practices that slot into your schedule. You get one dedicated planning session per month as part of the plan.</p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <section class="card">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">Quick diagnostic</h4>
          <form onsubmit="return false;">
            <label for="energy">Current energy pattern</label>
            <select id="energy">
              <option>Peaks in morning</option>
              <option>Afternoon dip</option>
              <option>Evenly paced</option>
            </select>
            <label for="stress">Typical stress level</label>
            <select id="stress">
              <option>Low</option>
              <option>Moderate</option>
              <option>High</option>
            </select>
            <label for="available">Time available daily (min)</label>
            <input id="available" type="number" value="20" min="5">
            <div style="margin-top:10px"><button id="diagBtn">Get a micro-plan</button></div>
          </form>
          <div id="diagOut" class="small" style="margin-top:10px">Result will appear here.</div>
        </section>

        <section class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">Contact</h4>
          <p class="small">Questions about coaching? Reach out:</p>
          <p style="margin:6px 0"><strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong></p>
          <p class="small">Prefer to talk: <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></p>
        </section>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <footer class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
        <div class="small">Serving clients in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        <div>
          <a class="small" href="pricing.html">Plans & pricing</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Session Planner logic
    function summarizePlan(focus,length,frequency,goal,notes){
      let lines = [];
      lines.push('Session focus: ' + focus);
      lines.push('Length: ' + length + ' minutes');
      lines.push('Sessions per week: ' + frequency);
      if(goal) lines.push('Target outcome: ' + goal);
      if(notes) lines.push('Coach note: ' + notes);
      lines.push('Suggested micro-steps:');
      lines.push('- Anchor: pick one consistent cue to begin the session');
      lines.push('- Tiny habit: 3 min warm-up, main 15-20 min, 2 min reflect');
      lines.push('\nMembership suggestion: schedule a monthly planning slot to review progress.');
      return lines.join('\n');
    }

    document.getElementById('buildPlan').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const focus = document.getElementById('focus').value;
      const length = document.getElementById('length').value;
      const freq = document.getElementById('frequency').value;
      const goal = document.getElementById('goal').value;
      const notes = document.getElementById('notes').value;
      const out = summarizePlan(focus,length,freq,goal,notes);
      document.getElementById('planOut').textContent = out;
    });

    document.getElementById('copyPlan').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const text = document.getElementById('planOut').textContent;
      if(!text){alert('Create a plan first.');return}
      navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function(){
        alert('Plan copied to clipboard');
      }, function(){
        const ta = document.createElement('textarea'); ta.value = text; document.body.appendChild(ta); ta.select(); try{document.execCommand('copy'); alert('Plan copied.')}catch(e){alert('Copy failed')} ta.remove();
      });
    });

    // Diagnostic micro-plan
    document.getElementById('diagBtn').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const energy = document.getElementById('energy').value;
      const stress = document.getElementById('stress').value;
      const avail = parseInt(document.getElementById('available').value,10)||10;
      let advice = 'Micro-plan:\n';
      advice += '- Time budget: ' + avail + ' min daily\n';
      if(energy.includes('morning')) advice += '- Place priority sessions in the morning when possible.\n';
      if(energy.includes('Afternoon')) advice += '- Use a 10-minute reset at 3pm: short walk or breathing.\n';
      if(stress==='High') advice += '- Start with micro-practices: 2 minutes of grounding before tasks.\n';
      advice += '\nTry one small change for 7 days and review. Members get a printable checklist each week.';
      document.getElementById('diagOut').textContent = advice;
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"services.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Support Plans — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fffefb;--card:#ffffff;--accent:#1f5f4d;--muted:#556b64}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;color:#083;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfdfc,#f0f8f4)}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 22px}
    nav a{margin:0 8px;color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .container{max-width:1000px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 18px}
    .hero{padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--card);box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(10,40,34,0.04)}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:26px;color:#063d33}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}
    .plans{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:14px}
    .plan{padding:16px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#f6fff9);border:1px solid rgba(10,40,34,0.04)}
    .plan h3{margin:0 0 6px}
    .price{font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);font-size:20px}
    .plan ul{padding-left:18px}
    .widget{margin-top:12px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(10,40,34,0.06);padding-top:12px}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:none;cursor:pointer}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    @media(max-width:980px){.plans{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    /* habit builder printable area */
    .checklist{background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #eaf3ee}
    .day{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:8px 0}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px"><strong style="color:var(--accent)">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong><span class="small">Membership + practical routines</span></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="services.html">Support Plans</a>
      <a href="programs.html">Rituals</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Join</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Support Plans: focus, coaching, and steady task flows</h1>
      <p class="muted">Choose a membership tier that matches how hands-on you want support to be. Each plan emphasizes habit formation, short weekly blueprints, and monthly personal planning sessions.</p>

      <div class="plans" role="list">
        <div class="plan" role="listitem">
          <h3>Core</h3>
          <div class="price">$29/mo</div>
          <ul class="small">
            <li>Weekly blueprint</li>
            <li>Access to resource library</li>
            <li>Monthly group check-in</li>
          </ul>
          <div style="margin-top:10px"><button class="btn" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'">Start Core</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="plan" role="listitem">
          <h3>Guided</h3>
          <div class="price">$69/mo</div>
          <ul class="small">
            <li>Weekly plan + edits</li>
            <li>Biweekly group call</li>
            <li>Monthly coaching session</li>
          </ul>
          <div style="margin-top:10px"><button class="btn" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'">Join Guided</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="plan" role="listitem">
          <h3>Dedicated</h3>
          <div class="price">$149/mo</div>
          <ul class="small">
            <li>Priority coaching</li>
            <li>Weekly 1:1 planning</li>
            <li>Custom habit design</li>
          </ul>
          <div style="margin-top:10px"><button class="btn" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'">Reserve Dedicated</button></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="widget" style="margin-top:16px">
        <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">7-day Challenge Builder</h4>
        <p class="small">Create a short checklist to try a habit for a week. Print or copy the list for daily use.</p>
        <label for="habitName">Habit name</label>
        <input id="habitName" type="text" placeholder="e.g., 10-minute morning stretch">
        <label for="habitLevel">Difficulty</label>
        <select id="habitLevel"><option>Easy</option><option>Moderate</option><option>Challenging</option></select>
        <label for="startDay">Start on</label>
        <select id="startDay">
          <option>Monday</option>
          <option>Tuesday</option>
          <option>Wednesday</option>
          <option>Thursday</option>
          <option>Friday</option>
          <option>Saturday</option>
          <option>Sunday</option>
        </select>
        <div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px">
          <button id="genChallenge" class="btn">Generate</button>
          <button id="printChallenge" class="btn" style="background:#356f5e">Print</button>
          <button id="copyChallenge" class="btn" style="background:#4b8a72">Copy</button>
        </div>
        <div id="challengeOut" class="checklist small" style="margin-top:10px">Your checklist will appear here.
        </div>
      </div>

    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start">
      <div style="flex:1">
        <div class="card" style="padding:12px;background:transparent">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">How we price</h3>
          <p class="muted">Pricing is framed around support cadence rather than features. Choose a tier based on how often you want personalized planning and how much accountability you need.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside style="width:320px">
        <div class="card" style="padding:12px;background:var(--card)">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">Session Planner (compact)</h4>
          <div class="small">Quickly draft a session plan and copy it.</div>
          <div style="margin-top:8px">
            <label for="s_focus">Focus</label>
            <select id="s_focus"><option>Movement</option><option>Breath</option><option>Sleep prep</option></select>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
              <input id="s_length" type="number" value="20" min="5">
              <input id="s_freq" type="number" value="3" min="1" max="7">
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px">
              <button id="s_build" class="btn">Build</button>
              <button id="s_copy" class="btn" style="background:#4b8a72">Copy</button>
            </div>
            <div id="s_out" class="small" style="margin-top:8px">Plan will appear here.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <footer style="margin-top:22px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Questions? Email <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong> or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong>.</footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Challenge builder
    function dayOrder(start){
      const days = ['Monday','Tuesday','Wednesday','Thursday','Friday','Saturday','Sunday'];
      const idx = days.indexOf(start);
      return days.slice(idx).concat(days.slice(0,idx));
    }
    document.getElementById('genChallenge').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const name = document.getElementById('habitName').value || 'Daily practice';
      const level = document.getElementById('habitLevel').value;
      const start = document.getElementById('startDay').value;
      const order = dayOrder(start);
      let html = '<strong>'+name+' ('+level+')</strong>\n';
      order.slice(0,7).forEach(function(d,i){ html += (i+1)+'. '+d+' — [  ]\n' });
      html += '\nNotes: Keep it small and repeat the same cue.';
      document.getElementById('challengeOut').textContent = html;
    });

    document.getElementById('copyChallenge').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const txt = document.getElementById('challengeOut').textContent;
      if(!txt){alert('Generate the checklist first.');return}
      navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt).then(()=>alert('Checklist copied.'),()=>alert('Copy failed.'));
    });
    document.getElementById('printChallenge').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const txt = document.getElementById('challengeOut').textContent || 'No checklist yet.';
      const win = window.open('about:blank','printwin');
      win.document.write('<pre style="font-family:system-ui;white-space:pre-wrap">'+txt.replace(/&/g,'&amp;').replace(/</g,'&lt;')+'</pre>');
      win.document.close();
      win.focus();
      setTimeout(()=>win.print(),300);
    });

    // Compact session planner
    function makeSmallPlan(focus,length,freq){
      return 'Focus: '+focus+'\nLength: '+length+' min\nFrequency: '+freq+'x/week\nTip: pair this with a consistent cue.';
    }
    document.getElementById('s_build').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const f = document.getElementById('s_focus').value;
      const l = document.getElementById('s_length').value;
      const q = document.getElementById('s_freq').value;
      document.getElementById('s_out').textContent = makeSmallPlan(f,l,q);
    });
    document.getElementById('s_copy').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const txt = document.getElementById('s_out').textContent;
      if(!txt){alert('Create the plan first.');return}
      navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt).then(()=>alert('Plan copied.'),()=>alert('Copy failed'));
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"programs.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Rituals & Programs — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f7fff9;--accent:#1b604e;--muted:#506b63}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;color:#082;background:var(--bg)}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:12px 22px}
    nav a{margin:0 8px;color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}
    .wrap{max-width:1000px;margin:20px auto;padding:0 18px}
    .leadCard{background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(8,36,30,0.04)}
    h1{margin:0 0 6px;color:#063d33}
    .subtitle{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px}
    .programs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px;margin-top:16px}
    .list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .prog{background:#ffffff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border-left:4px solid rgba(27,96,78,0.08)}
    .prog h3{margin:0}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}
    .cta{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:none}
    .widget{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;background:#fff;border-radius:10px}
    @media(max-width:980px){.programs{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px"><strong style="color:var(--accent)">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong><span class="muted">Rituals that fit the day</span></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="services.html">Support Plans</a>
      <a href="programs.html">Rituals</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Join</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="leadCard">
      <h1>Short programs to build a steady week</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Each program focuses on a single habit cluster and provides a printable 7-day checklist plus a short session template you can copy into your calendar.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="programs">
      <div>
        <div class="list">
          <div class="prog">
            <h3>Morning Movement Mini</h3>
            <p class="muted">A 2-week introduction to a short morning practice. Gentle progressions and a 7-day starter checklist.</p>
            <div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
              <button class="cta" onclick="openProgram('Morning Movement Mini','2 weeks','A 10-minute routine to wake the body')">Open</button>
              <a href="pricing.html" style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700">Join this program</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="prog">
            <h3>Evening Calm Flow</h3>
            <p class="muted">Simple cues and a short wind-down sequence to help settle attention before bed.</p>
            <div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
              <button class="cta" onclick="openProgram('Evening Calm Flow','1 week','A short sequence to prepare for sleep')">Open</button>
              <a href="pricing.html" style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700">Join this program</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="prog">
            <h3>Focus Blocks Reset</h3>
            <p class="muted">Design 2-3 focus blocks per day and pair them with micro-break habits to protect attention.</p>
            <div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
              <button class="cta" onclick="openProgram('Focus Blocks Reset','3 weeks','Restructure attention with three daily anchors')">Open</button>
              <a href="pricing.html" style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700">Join this program</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section style="margin-top:14px;background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">Session Planner</h4>
          <p class="muted">Create a session template for any program and copy it to your notes.</p>
          <label class="muted" for="prog_focus">Focus</label>
          <input id="prog_focus" type="text" placeholder="e.g., wind-down" />
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <input id="prog_length" type="number" value="15" min="5" />
            <input id="prog_count" type="number" value="5" min="1" />
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px">
            <button id="prog_build" class="cta">Create</button>
            <button id="prog_copy" class="cta" style="background:#246e59">Copy</button>
          </div>
          <div id="prog_out" class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Your program plan will appear here.</div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="widget">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">Create a 7-day checklist</h4>
          <p class="muted">Pick a program and generate a printable checklist for the next seven days.</p>
          <label for="selectProg">Program</label>
          <select id="selectProg">
            <option>Morning Movement Mini</option>
            <option>Evening Calm Flow</option>
            <option>Focus Blocks Reset</option>
          </select>
          <label for="startDate" style="margin-top:8px">Start date</label>
          <input id="startDate" type="date">
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <button id="makeChecklist" class="cta">Generate</button>
            <button id="printChecklist" class="cta" style="background:#246e59">Print</button>
          </div>
          <div id="checkArea" class="muted" style="margin-top:10px">The 7-day checklist will appear here.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="widget" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">Why short programs?</h4>
          <p class="muted">Short, specific cycles are easier to finish and to evaluate. Each includes a reproducible session template and daily prompts that you can repeat and adapt.</p>
          <p class="muted">Membership provides monthly program rotations and access to printable checklists like these.</p>
